":"Footwear Visualiser"},{"text":"Design Researcher"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Students can also move into:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Merchandising"},{"text":"Product development"},{"text":"Sourcing"},{"text":"Materials development"},{"text":"Trend research"}]}]},{"heading":"Interview Preparation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Prepare for questions such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Why footwear design?"},{"text":"Explain the anatomy of a shoe."},{"text":"How do you design a sneaker from scratch?"},{"text":"How do you choose materials?"},{"text":"What role does a last play?"},{"text":"How do you balance aesthetics and comfort?"},{"text":"What factors influence sole design?"},{"text":"How does footwear construction affect design?"},{"text":"How would you design sustainable footwear?"},{"text":"What makes performance footwear different from fashion footwear?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio question"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Walk us through your strongest footwear project.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Explain:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User","Research","Problem","Inspiration","Sketches","Material decisions","Construction","Prototype","Testing","Iteration","Final design"]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Relevant directions include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Footwear Design"},{"type":"p","text":"For deeper specialisation."},{"type":"h","text":"Fashion Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for fashion/luxury footwear."},{"type":"h","text":"Product / Industrial Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for technical and performance products."},{"type":"h","text":"Accessory Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Footwear"},{"text":"Bags"},{"text":"Leather goods"},{"text":"Lifestyle products"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Design Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Useful for future:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product managers"},{"text":"Design strategists"},{"text":"B